    "title": "SCENE VI. London. A street",
    "location": "London. A street",
    "orderInPlay": 14
  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter a Scrivener."
    },
    {
      "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "scrivener",
        "name": "SCRIVENER",
        "displayName": "Scrivener"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Here is the indictment of the good Lord Hastings,",
          "plainText": "Here is the indictment of the good Lord Hastings",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Which in a set hand fairly is engrossed,",
          "plainText": "Which in a set hand fairly is engrossed",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "That it may be today read o'er in Paul's.",
          "plainText": "That it may be today read o'er in Paul's",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "And mark how well the sequel hangs together:",
          "plainText": "And mark how well the sequel hangs together",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Eleven hours I have spent to write it over,",
          "plainText": "Eleven hours I have spent to write it over",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "For yesternight by Catesby was it sent me;",
          "plainText": "For yesternight by Catesby was it sent me",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "The precedent was full as long a-doing",
          "plainText": "The precedent was full as long adoing",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "And yet within these five hours Hastings lived,",
          "plainText": "And yet within these five hours Hastings lived",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Untainted, unexamined, free, at liberty.",
          "plainText": "Untainted unexamined free at liberty",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "Here's a good world the while! Who is so gross",
          "plainText": "Here's a good world the while Who is so gross",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "That cannot see this palpable device?",
          "plainText": "That cannot see this palpable device",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 12,
          "text": "Yet who so bold but says he sees it not?",
          "plainText": "Yet who so bold but says he sees it not",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 13,
          "text": "Bad is the world, and all will come to naught",
          "plainText": "Bad is the world and all will come to naught",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 14,
          "text": "When such ill dealing must be seen in thought.",
          "plainText": "When such ill dealing must be seen in thought",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "king-richard-the-third-3-6-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exit.]"
    }
  ]
}